      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-2f40e912",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0019",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "汇票是出票人签发的，委托付款人在见票时或者在指定日期无条件支付确定的金额给收款人或者持票人的票据。",
      "quoteHash": "2f40e91289fb9d45af96e48a040bba8f5f1dfc77f8222d0f3815cfea9f5d446d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-ee60b515",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0024",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "汇票上可以记载本法规定事项以外的其他出票事项，但是该记载事项不具有汇票上的效力。",
      "quoteHash": "ee60b515d89876d45e012f71654903916b23788e6b6f0358d7dd52e0b040cad5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-b85a348d",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0026",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "出票人签发汇票后，即承担保证该汇票承兑和付款的责任。出票人在汇票得不到承兑或者付款时，应当向持票人清偿本法第七十条、第七十一条规定的金额和费用。",
      "quoteHash": "b85a348d301f3dc415069bcacee17c6102e087c7376bfbad6b8767fa3a30613a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-135526d7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "背书不得附有条件。背书时附有条件的，所附条件不具有汇票上的效力。",
      "quoteHash": "135526d7d06cd42494e80b9da9b7079fd98937536882f2bab2026e5b699b50a8",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-0cf5b1a2",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0037",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "背书人以背书转让汇票后，即承担保证其后手所持汇票承兑和付款的责任。背书人在汇票得不到承兑或者付款时，应当向持票人清偿本法第七十条、第七十一条规定的金额和费用。",
      "quoteHash": "0cf5b1a22710e044779b66919500e64a24a08d9be07dc7eab863c6ad2d221c63",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-3f04cf41",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0043",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "付款人承兑汇票，不得附有条件；承兑附有条件的，视为拒绝承兑。",
      "quoteHash": "3f04cf4151a924b2903113906b544bfc4aab897e850863501733e09e4ff7a736",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF003-20260922-fd3ba439",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF003-403bbd7c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0048",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "保证不得附有条件；附有条件的，不影响对汇票的保证责任。",
      "quoteHash": "403bbd7cce8da08214c42c80ef9c1648b7ee550a7c302207f2fff092d7f50f40",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "fd3ba439c11d5c65d7aece2943cc37a814c431fb067fd5f41f14b65318d364b8",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-003",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-003.md",
