      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-84773271",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF003-0080",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本票的背书、保证、付款行为和追索权的行使，除本章规定外，适用本法第二章有关汇票的规定。",
      "quoteHash": "951b7879dc319f0b5a801b148290db0fd8c8277568c4ba81ce2e71d6b95358b2",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
